{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234400","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14234400","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1423440001:1":{"text":"うぅっ……ミーちゃん！見つけてくれてありがとう！","source_cn":"呜呜……咪咪回来了！谢谢你们找到它！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDDAD528D2DC8EDF2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423440002:1":{"text":"待て！そなたの言う「ミーちゃん」は、我が家より失せた愛玩動物ぞ！何ゆえそなたの手に！？","source_cn":"站住！汝口中所谓“咪咪”，乃吾遗失之家宠！汝从何处得来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB81AD1DFA8952BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423440003:1":{"text":"……あの人、何を言ってるの？","source_cn":"他说的话是什么意思……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3569B133AE3B7AB7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423440004:1":{"text":"えっと……ミーちゃんはあの人がなくしたペットで、どこで見つけたのか聞いてるんだと思います……","source_cn":"他说咪咪是他丢失的宠物，问你从哪里得到的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68DCD9517FF42D02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1423440005:1":{"text":"ミーちゃんは、草むらで拾ったの。すごく痩せてて、あたしが大事にお世話したの……","source_cn":"呜……咪咪是我在草丛里捡到的，那个时候它很瘦，我把它照...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01EB28A4DABF34C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title